cap resource usage dynamically, ensuring better scalability under heavy loads.\">\n      <option name=\"closed\" value=\"true\" />\n      <created>1784095629273</created>\n      <option name=\"number\" value=\"00035\" />\n      <option name=\"presentableId\" value=\"LOCAL-00035\" />\n      <option name=\"project\" value=\"LOCAL\" />\n      <updated>1784095629273</updated>\n    </task>\n    <task id=\"LOCAL-00036\" summary=\"Refactor code for improved readability and formatting.&#10;&#10;Enhanced code readability by reformatting multi-line constructs such as match arms, function calls, and array definitions. Applied consistent indentation and alignment to enhance maintainability and prepare for future contributions.\">\n      <option name=\"closed\" value=\"true\" />\n      <created>1784102007028</created>\n      <option name=\"number\" value=\"00036\" />\n      <option name=\"presentableId\" value=\"LOCAL-00036\" />\n      <option name=\"project\" value=\"LOCAL\" />\n      <updated>1784102007028</updated>\n    </task>\n    <option name=\"localTasksCounter\" value=\"37\" />\n    <servers />\n  </component>\n  <component name=\"TypeScriptGeneratedFilesManager\">\n    <option name=\"version\" value=\"3\" />\n  </component>\n  <component name=\"UnknownFeatures\">\n    <option featureType=\"com.intellij.fileTypeFactory\" implementationName=\"*.py\" />\n  </component>\n  <component name=\"VcsManagerConfiguration\">\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Improve OAuth `redirect_uri` handling for custom providers&#10;&#10;Added fallback logic to build an absolute `redirect_uri` when missing or relative, ensuring compatibility with custom/injected providers and satisfying requirements like Microsoft's absolute URI enforcement.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Refactor OAuth provider resolution logic&#10;&#10;Simplified and streamlined the logic for mapping OAuth provider keys and Social Login Keys, improving maintainability and error handling.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Refactor OAuth key resolution and provider mapping logic&#10;&#10;Streamlined methods for resolving OAuth providers and Social Login Keys, removed redundant code, and enhanced error handling for improved maintainability and stability.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Refactor OAuth provider resolution and key mapping&#10;&#10;Simplified and optimized the logic for resolving OAuth provider types, Social Login Keys, and configuration keys. Improved error handling, logging, and provider compatibility checks. Removed redundant fallback code for provider configuration.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Improve logging and error handling for initialization paths&#10;&#10;Enhanced initialization logic for the crash-durable log engine in Rust and added comprehensive fallback mechanisms for building redirect_uri in Python. Improved debug logging in both cases to aid troubleshooting and clarify error contexts.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Refactor OAuth `redirect_uri` logic for better request context handling&#10;&#10;Simplified the construction of `redirect_uri` by prioritizing request headers and context over fallback mechanisms. Ensured compatibility with Microsoft Entra ID by enforcing absolute URI requirements. Streamlined error handling for edge cases.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Enhance OAuth `redirect_uri` handling with improved fallback logic and detailed debug logging\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Refactor OAuth provider mapping and enhance Microsoft tenant configuration&#10;&#10;Streamlined the logic for resolving OAuth provider keys and Social Login Keys. Added support to dynamically configure tenant-specific Microsoft OAuth endpoints using tenant IDs from environment or config. Improved compatibility by rewriting `/common/` endpoints to tenant-specific URLs.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add enhanced logging and tenant-specific handling for OAuth providers&#10;&#10;Improved debug and warning logs for OAuth provider flows. Added logic to rewrite `/common/` Microsoft OAuth endpoints to tenant-specific URLs. Enhanced flow configuration to ensure compatibility and accuracy of authorization and token exchange mechanisms.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add detailed debug logging for OAuth provider resolution and Social Login Key matching steps\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add `restrict_to_domain` field to Doctype and enhance workspace child-table handling\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add support for page fixtures and extend infrastructure UI&#10;&#10;Introduced handling for page fixtures in `sync_all()` to enable better alignment with permission checks and native pages. Updated infrastructure workspace and frontend screens to include new shortcuts and links, such as &quot;Server Token Generator&quot; and &quot;SEBRUS::OPS&quot; pages. Enhanced database handling for pages with additional fields like `restrict_to_domain`.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Update log engine data files and index metadata&#10;&#10;Refreshed log entries in `wal.ndjson`, updated `.managed.json` with new index files, and modified `meta.json` to include new segments.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add workspace redirects and enhance fleet UI filtering&#10;&#10;Introduced redirects for custom workspace pages in Rust runtime to align with new URL structure. Enhanced fleet UI with status-based filtering and visibility counts, improving user experience in Ops Portal. Updated log engine data files and index metadata to reflect recent changes in logs and segments.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Implement batch processing of logs and optimize vulnerability scans.&#10;&#10;Add batch ingestion to reduce write overhead for high-frequency logs. Optimize vulnerability scans by batching database writes, skipping unchanged servers, and enhancing OSV concurrency limits. Also introduce telemetry and heartbeat caching for improved performance.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add real-time RAM caching for log ingestion and fleet status.&#10;&#10;Introduced an in-memory staging buffer for log records to enhance ingestion performance by reducing disk