e_detail` implementation.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add support for dismissing pending OS updates&#10;&#10;Introduced a new &quot;Dismiss&quot; action in the frontend to hide pending updates already installed outside the agent. Added backend API method `audit_ready.dismiss_pending_update` to apply dismiss\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Add support for dismissing pending OS updates&#10;&#10;Introduced a new &quot;Dismiss&quot; action in the frontend to hide pending updates already installed outside the agent. Added backend API method `audit_ready.dismiss_pending_update` to apply dismissals persistently and filter them from pending updates. Updated README and relevant modules.\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Replace `strongroom` with `audit_ready` in runtime workspace dependencies\" />\n    <MESSAGE value=\"Fiixed massive db error\" />\n    <option name=\"LAST_COMMIT_MESSAGE\" value=\"Fiixed massive db error\" />\n  </component>\n</project>
